      "html": "<section class=\"ds-package\" aria-label=\"cas-evo package\"><div class=\"ds-package-heading\"><div class=\"ds-package-name\"><svg width=\"25\" height=\"25\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7h18v14H3zM2 3h20v4H2zM9 11h6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><h2>cas-evo <span>v1</span></h2></div><span class=\"ds-destination\">Compiled for EVO</span></div><div class=\"ds-package-description\"><p>Exact answers. On your EVO.</p><p>Algebra, calculus, series and differential equations, with an editor and typeset results.</p></div></section>",
